# Tests.AnchorsAes — D342 (V4): the AES-NI, VPCLMULQDQ and VEX-shuffle pins, in a module of their own

Arm (A) of the 2026-10-10 kernel-cost fork, taken from the start (D342 prediction 4): these `decide` pins never enter
`Tests.Anchors`. They are a NEW unit, judged once against an absolute registration measured on its own machine
(`scripts/kernel_ceilings.txt`, `scripts/ku_delta_budget.txt`).

The block between the markers is GENERATED by `hwprobe/mk_aes_anchors.py` (`--check` gates it byte for byte).

LANE. Personal lane, public sources only.
-/
